### Description:
This Terraform program creates an AWS Lex bot named "PizzaOrderBot" that allows users to order pizza through a conversational interface. The bot includes a main intent for ordering pizza and a follow-up question intent to gather additional details about the order.

### Terraform HCL Program:

```hcl
provider "aws" {
  region = "us-east-1"
}

variable "bot_name" {
  default = "PizzaOrderBot"
}

variable "intent_name" {
  default = "OrderPizzaIntent"
}

variable "followup_intent_name" {
  default = "OrderDetailsIntent"
}

