### Description:
This Terraform program creates an AWS Lex Bot named "PizzaOrderBot" that supports five different intents for ordering pizzas. The bot includes intents for placing an order, canceling an order, checking the status of an order, adding toppings, and removing toppings. It also includes a slot type for pizza sizes.

### Terraform HCL Program:

```hcl
provider "aws" {
  region = "us-east-1"
}

variable "bot_name" {
  default = "PizzaOrderBot"
}

variable "intent_names" {
  default = [
    "PlaceOrder",
    "CancelOrder",
    "CheckStatus",
    "AddToppings",
    "RemoveToppings"
  ]
}

