This Terraform program creates two AWS Chime Voice Connectors, each with encryption enabled. It then creates an `aws_chime_voice_connector_group` resource that groups these two connectors, with one prioritized over the other.

### Terraform HCL Program:

```hcl
provider "aws" {
  region = "us-east-1"  # Specify your desired AWS region
}

# Define variables with default values
variable "voice_connector_name_prefix" {
  default = "chime-vc"
}

variable "encryption_type" {
  default = "AES256"
}

# Create the first Chime Voice Connector
