- **IAM Roles**: Two IAM roles (`redshift-reader-role` and `redshift-writer-role`) are created to manage access to the Redshift cluster. These roles are attached to the cluster to grant read-only and full access permissions, respectively.
- **Subnet Group**: A subnet group is created to manage the subnets where the Redshift cluster will be deployed.
