This Terraform program creates an AWS S3 bucket and configures it with a CORS (Cross-Origin Resource Sharing) rule. The CORS rule allows specific origins to access the bucket, enabling cross-origin requests from those origins.

### Terraform HCL Program:

```hcl
provider "aws" {
  region = "us-west-2"  # Specify your desired AWS region
}

variable "bucket_name" {
  description = "The name of the S3 bucket"
  default     = "my-cors-bucket"
}

