This Terraform program creates an AWS S3 bucket with a CORS configuration that allows POST and GET requests from a specified website domain. The program includes a provider configuration for AWS, a resource for the S3 bucket, and a resource for the CORS configuration.

### Terraform HCL Program

```hcl
provider "aws" {
  region = "us-west-2" # Specify your desired AWS region
}

variable "bucket_name" {
  default = "my-website-bucket"
}

variable "website_domain" {
  default = "https://domain.com"
}

