### Description:
This Terraform program creates an Amazon Elastic File System (EFS) with automatic backups enabled. The EFS will be provisioned in a specified region and will have a default size of 100 GiB. It will also be configured to automatically backup every 24 hours.

### Terraform HCL Program:

```hcl
provider "aws" {
  region = var.region
}

variable "region" {
  description = "The AWS region where the EFS will be created."
  type        = string
  default     = "us-west-2"
}

